# GitHub reads this file to show "Cite this repository", and Zenodo reads it to
# describe each archived release.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this catalogue, please cite it as below, and cite the papers
  listed on the page of each factory you use.
type: dataset
title: "Magic State Factory Catalog"
abstract: >-
  An open catalogue of verified magic-state distillation factories. Every
  factory is stored as an explicit circuit, and every figure of merit is
  re-derived from that circuit. Each factory has a permanent label n.k.d.x.
authors:
  - family-names: Jain
    given-names: Shubham P.
  - family-names: Singh
    given-names: Shraddha
repository-code: "https://github.com/shubhamj810/magic-state-factory-repo"
url: "https://shubhamj810.github.io/magic-state-factory-repo/"
keywords:
  - magic-state distillation
  - fault-tolerant quantum computing
  - quantum error correction
  - triorthogonal codes
